  "description": "Matt Ray has been a part of BMX and Subrosa for a long time now. He continues to push the limits of his riding and push the limits of his products. His signature frame has gone through a few variations, and we’re stoked to present the MR3.\n\nWhile this new version of his frame isn’t much different than the previous version Matt did fine tune a few specs like lowering the BB Height and adding a longer Top Tube option. Check out the new decals too!\n\nNeutral geometry for responsiveness and stability\n\nGreat all round frame for all types of riding\n\nHigh-quality chromoly construction\n\nRemovable brake hardware (Brake hardware not included)\n\nIntegrated seat post clamp",
